'''Blue Synthwave''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] knife obtained by finishing in the top 100 on the token collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
'''Blue Synthwave''' is the Ancient variation of [[Synthwave]] Evo knife, but colored with a blue border and a blue-to-black gradient.

